  (text "ADC\n- U502 makes a differential signal: 1 Vrms at PRE_OUT = 2 Vrms differential = 0 dBFS on the CS5361\n  (full scale = 1.13 x VA = 5.65 V p-p differential at VA = 5 V).\n- U503 CS5361: slave mode, I2S, HPF on. M0/M1 speed mode set by XMOS per sample rate.\n  Unused right channel tied to VQ. OVFL drives the clip LED.\n- VERIFY: CS5361 FILT+/VQ capacitor values and input RC against the datasheet."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "802f27a5-7792-5aa0-b100-4d370825ecf3")
  )
